# Non-secret Cloud Functions configuration for the demo project.
# Secrets live in Secret Manager and are never stored here.

# Result finalizer activation. off | canary | enabled
# An unrecognised value resolves to off, so this file cannot accidentally grant authority.
#
# Stage 4, approved by the owner for the DEMO environment only on 2026-08-08 after the
# canary passed all twelve checks in the cloud. `enabled` gives the finalizer authority
# over every future eligible confirmed submission. It does not replay history: Firestore
# event triggers fire only on future writes, and no scheduled sweeper is deployed.
#
# Rollback is this line: set to `off` and redeploy the two finalizer functions.
# `canary` is retained as an operational state so authority can be narrowed without a
# code change.
#
# Narrowed to `canary` on 2026-08-09 while surplus reconciliation was corrected, and
# returned to `enabled` the same day after the surplus canary passed in the cloud: a
# contradictory result (submitted 2-0, events reconstructing 5-0) produced zero official
# records of any kind, one deterministic League-review case, and stayed idempotent across
# a duplicate delivery.
# Returned to `enabled` on 2026-08-23 after the adversarial cloud canary proved the DEPLOYED
# function rejects an oversized claim before constructing events: finalizationStatus
# blocked_oversized_submission, zero official events, one reviewable exception naming both the
# scorer cap and the write budget, no timeout.
#
# It was set to canary because the deployed function was still running source uploaded
# 2026-08-19 — six commits behind the repository — while a status report claimed the fix was
# live because App Hosting had rolled out. An App Hosting rollout does not update a Cloud
# Function. Verify the function's own source generation, not the app revision.
GOALPLACE_FINALIZER_MODE=enabled

# Submission ids the finalizer may process while in canary mode. Ignored while the mode
# is `enabled`; kept populated-empty so returning to `canary` is one word, not a rewrite.
GOALPLACE_FINALIZER_CANARY_SUBMISSION_IDS=

# App Hosting origin the scheduled jobs call. Public URL, not a credential.
GOALPLACE_PAYMENT_CALLBACK_BASE_URL=https://fan22--manifest-quasar-479416-s7.us-east4.hosted.app
